+    """
+    Return the field-by-field usage in *total* that is not already in *base*.
+
+    Unlike ``RunUsage.__sub__`` (``usage.py``), which returns ``None`` for ``cost``
+    whenever it is unchanged -- indistinguishable from "unknown" -- ``cost`` here is
