+    """Not sure why but the default resolver returns sometime 4 positional args and sometime 2.
+
+    When it returns 4, they are organized as follow
+        - field name
+        - ???
+        - parent
+        - info
+    When it returns 2, they are organized as follow
+        - parent
+        - info
